<td>Short description and icons</td>
<td>Online listings and leaflets</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Care and compliance</td>
<td>Third side</td>
<td>Honest, transparent guidance</td>
<td>Instructions and contact details</td>
<td>After purchase reading</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Seasonal promotions</td>
