<td>Highlight limited campaigns</td>
<td>Stickers, ribbons, themed art</td>
<td>Holiday and event sales</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Eco messaging</td>
<td>Any supporting panel</td>
<td>Show material awareness</td>
<td>Recycling icons and short notes</td>
<td>Brands with sustainability focus</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Cross selling cues</td>
